{
    "title": "Mico - Widget & Wallpaper",
    "description": "Mico is a mobile phone beautification application, with rich home screen and lock screen widgets, exquisite high-definition 3D depth-of-field wallpapers, to help you create a personalized home screen. \r\n\u3010Home Screen Widgets\u3011 \r\nSupport transparent background widgets, one-click setting advanced ins style home screen. Widgets with many practical functions, photos, panels, cute battery, music player, home screen audio, creative animation... Various and interesting styles to meet your individual needs! \r\nYou can personalize your aesthetic lock screen- 100% unique your own \u201ciScreen\u201d.\r\n*WidgetSimth: There are various widgets here, just like Mr.Widget-Smith, decorate your phone anytime and anywhere\r\n*Photo widget: provide a variety of styles of photo frames, cute pets, retro game consoles, movie film styles, everything \r\n*Panel widget: one widget can view power, date, wifi, bluetooth and other device data, as well as creative animation, more distinctive \r\n*Power widget: The power widget that changes expression with the amount of power *Creative animation: professionally designed creative animation, let you have a dynamic home screen. \r\n\u3010Lock Screen Widgets\u3011 \r\nWith more than 300 styles and functions of lock screen widgets, now supports: animation widgets, pattern copywriting, icon widgets, quick launch. Meet your daily needs and landscaping needs. \r\n*Animation widgets: emoticon packs, flashing emoticons, GIF, bear emoticon animations, cute cat animations, flashing hearts... \r\n*Pattern copywriting: provide a copywriting library, including cute pattern emoticons, interesting emoji expression phrases, high-end phrases, etc., a daily sentence of self-affirmation and motivation, flexible matching of various patterns, colors, and text styles, both elegant and stylish There is temperature! \r\n*Icon Widget: Provide more than 200 kinds of cute icon picture stickers, it is your intimate beautification housekeeper~ Each widget provides a personalized editing function. You can upload your favorite pictures/GIFs to customize the widget. Come and DIY a theme exclusive to you! \r\n*Mico Lock Screen Widget integrates Apple Health App to display health data such as steps in widgets. If you want to use a super widget that contains health data, please allow the APP to access health data when entering the widget preview page. \r\n\u30104K HD Wallpaper\u3011 \r\nHigh-definition pictures, suitable for various models. A large number of wallpapers are waiting for you to choose, with various styles, including popular landscape wallpapers, ins wallpapers, creative wallpapers, two-dimensional home screen wallpapers, and idol wallpapers. Supports one-click saving of high-definition HD wallpapers to the photo album, and can also set specific wallpapers for different focus modes! \r\n\u3010DIY Wallpaper\u3011 \r\nTakes your phone personalization to the next level! Now, you can transform your favorite photos or artistic designs into vibrant wallpapers with ease. Explore a wide range of customization options, from adjusting the crop and layout to applying filters and effects. Unleash your creativity and make your phone's screen a true reflection of your unique style. \r\n\r\nDownload Mico now to make your device unique!\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions, please contact us via email: mikelockscreen@163.com",
