eper~ Each widget provides a personalized editing function. You can upload your favorite pictures/GIFs to customize the widget. Come and DIY a theme exclusive to you! <br>*Mico Lock Screen Widget integrates Apple Health App to display health data such as steps in widgets. If you want to use a super widget that contains health data, please allow the APP to access health data when entering the widget preview page. <br>\u30104K HD Wallpaper\u3011 <br>High-definition pictures, suitable for various models. A large number of wallpapers are waiting for you to choose, with various styles, including popular landscape wallpapers, ins wallpapers, creative wallpapers, two-dimensional home screen wallpapers, and idol wallpapers. Supports one-click saving of high-definition HD wallpapers to the photo album, and can also set specific wallpapers for different focus modes! <br>\u3010DIY Wallpaper\u3011 <br>Takes your phone personalization to the next level! Now, you can transform your favorite photos or artistic designs into vibrant wallpapers with ease. Explore a wide range of customization options, from adjusting the crop and layout to applying filters and effects. Unleash your creativity and make your phone&#39;s screen a true reflection of your unique style. <br><br>Download Mico now to make your device unique!<br><br>If you have any questions, please contact us via email: mikelockscreen@163.com",
